        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🃏 Flashcard Generator\n\nEnter a topic; an AI writes each card as a structured front/back/category object (not a markdown blob). Because they are rows and not prose, a Code node can then compute on them: drop repeated questions, deal one card from each category in turn so a run never asks four questions about the same sub-topic back to back, and stamp each card with its Leitner review days.\n\n**Pipeline:** Topic + card count → build prompt → generate card objects → one script that dedupes, orders and schedules them\n\n**Try this:** compare the two outputs — the raw rows the model wrote, and the same cards in study order."
        },
